      <title>ROUNDUP: Reigning champ Ripon caps TVL girls soccer season with shutout at Escalon</title>
      <link>https://www.mantecabulletin.com/sports/high-school-sports/roundup-reigning-champ-ripon-caps-tvl-girls-soccer-season-with-shutout-at-escalon/</link>
      <description>Ripon’s girls soccer team completed another dominant Trans Valley League season Monday with a 2-0 victory at Escalon. The Indians (10-1-1, 19-5-1 overall) claimed at least a share of the last seven league titles, this year’s squad established a new program record with its 17th shutout.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.mantecabulletin.com/sports/high-school-sports/roundup-reigning-champ-ripon-caps-tvl-girls-soccer-season-with-shutout-at-escalon/</guid>
